            <note corresp="#d278-f1" n="1" xml:id="d278-f1-content">
                <p>
                    Adlai E. Stevenson, in 1946 an adviser to the U.S.
                    Delegation to the first part of the First Session of the General Assembly at
                    London.</p>
            </note>
